  "description": "# Daejeon\n\n## DAJ · v0.3.1\n\nCustom map of Daejeon, Korea, built from official Korean government transport and demographic data.\n\n## Coverage\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><td><strong>Region</strong></td><td>대전광역시, 세종특별자치시, 충청남도, 충청북도</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Playable Area</strong></td><td>1,609 km²</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<details>\n<summary>District list (14)</summary>\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">시군구</th><th align=\"left\">District</th><th align=\"right\">Population</th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>대전광역시</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>대덕구</td><td>Daedeok-gu</td><td align=\"right\">233,379</td></tr>\n<tr><td>동구</td><td>Dong-gu</td><td align=\"right\">684,524</td></tr>\n<tr><td>서구</td><td>Seo-gu</td><td align=\"right\">474,649</td></tr>\n<tr><td>유성구</td><td>Yuseong-gu</td><td align=\"right\">409,697</td></tr>\n<tr><td>중구</td><td>Jung-gu</td><td align=\"right\">313,288</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>세종특별자치시</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>세종시</td><td>Sejong City</td><td align=\"right\">308,162</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>충청남도</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>계룡시</td><td>Gyeryong-si</td><td align=\"right\">63,874</td></tr>\n<tr><td>공주시</td><td>Gongju-si</td><td align=\"right\">20,390</td></tr>\n<tr><td>금산군</td><td>Geumsan-gun</td><td align=\"right\">19,427</td></tr>\n<tr><td>논산시</td><td>Nonsan-si</td><td align=\"right\">10,997</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>충청북도</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>보은군</td><td>Boeun-gun</td><td align=\"right\">2,402</td></tr>\n<tr><td>옥천군</td><td>Okcheon-gun</td><td align=\"right\">48,074</td></tr>\n<tr><td>청주시 상당구</td><td>Sangdang-gu Cheongju-si</td><td align=\"right\">3,474</td></tr>\n<tr><td>청주시 서원구</td><td>Seowon-gu Cheongju-si</td><td align=\"right\">2,897</td></tr>\n</table>\n</details>\n\n## Population Summary\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><td><strong>Total Modeled Demand</strong></td><td align=\"right\">717,264</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Pops</strong></td><td align=\"right\">15,274</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n## Additional Features\n\n- **Neighborhood Labels** — The map includes municipal and neighborhood labels derived from administrative boundary data.\n\t- 시도 (Si, Do - Metropolitan / Provincial level)\n\t- 시군구 (Si, Gun, Gu - City / County / District level)\n\t- 읍면동 (Eup, Myeon, Dong - Neighborhood level)\n\n## Data Sources\n\n- Korean Transportation Database (Korea Transport Institute, KOTI) (ktdb.go.kr)\n- V-world (Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport, MOLIT) (vworld.kr)\n- Statistical Geographic Information System (SGIS) plus (Ministry of Data and Statistics, MODS) (sgis.mods.go.kr)\n- Address-based Industry Support Service (Ministry of the Interior and Safety, MOIS) (business.juso.go.kr)\n- Aviation statistics 2025 (Korea Civil Aviation Association, KCAA) (airportal.go.kr)\n- Korean railroad statistics 2024 (Korea Railroad, KORAIL) (railstat.korail.com)\n- Korean Public Transportation Database (Korea Transportation Safety Authority, KTSA) (kotsa.or.kr)\n- Korean Hospital and Pharmacy Status (Health Insurance Review and Assessment Service, HIRA) (data.go.kr)\n- Health Insurance Medical Statistics (HIRA) (opendata.hira.or.kr)\n- Academy Information System (Ministry of Education, MOE) (academyinfo.go.kr)\n\n## Credits\n\nMap authored by budhakr",
